{"4544030": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "I'm blocked", "steam_appid": 4544030, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, your objective is to survive for 14 days by protecting yourself inside your house.  To stay alive, you must build and maintain wooden barricades that cover the windows of your shelter. These barricades are essential for your survival and must be placed and repaired using wood.  At the beginning of the game, a radio message informs you that you need to stay inside and wait for the authorities to arrive. After that, you are on your own and must rely on your actions to survive.  To gather resources, you can go into the garden and cut down trees using an axe. By cutting trees, you obtain wood, which is the only resource used to create and repair barricades. Managing your wood carefully is important, as you need enough to keep your defenses intact for the entire duration.  Your goal is to survive all 14 days by maintaining your barricades and making sure your shelter remains protected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4544030/extras/df9d163a80fc9a82766f5f07f433487a.avif?t=1784487242\" width=1560 height=975 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a left-click pickup mechanic and a right-click throw mechanic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4544030/extras/232e413ccc3e0159cbf0be634bbd73df.poster.avif?t=1784487242\" width=1170 height=730 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4544030/extras/232e413ccc3e0159cbf0be634bbd73df.webm?t=1784487242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4544030/extras/232e413ccc3e0159cbf0be634bbd73df.mp4?t=1784487242\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your barricade and place it on the windows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4544030/extras/738c708e295a8cacccabffeb9d9bf996.poster.avif?t=1784487242\" width=1170 height=730 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4544030/extras/738c708e295a8cacccabffeb9d9bf996.webm?t=1784487242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4544030/extras/738c708e295a8cacccabffeb9d9bf996.mp4?t=1784487242\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To get more wood, you have to pick up the axe and throw it at the tree.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4544030/extras/26fb632031da2dd64b5f77d725445176.poster.avif?t=1784487242\" width=1170 height=730 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4544030/extras/26fb632031da2dd64b5f77d725445176.webm?t=1784487242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4544030/extras/26fb632031da2dd64b5f77d725445176.mp4?t=1784487242\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, your objective is to survive for 14 days by protecting yourself inside your house.  To stay alive, you must build and maintain wooden barricades that cover the windows of your shelter. These barricades are essential for your survival and must be placed and repaired using wood.  At the beginning of the game, a radio message informs you that you need to stay inside and wait for the authorities to arrive. After that, you are on your own and must rely on your actions to survive.  To gather resources, you can go into the garden and cut down trees using an axe. By cutting trees, you obtain wood, which is the only resource used to create and repair barricades. Managing your wood carefully is important, as you need enough to keep your defenses intact for the entire duration.  Your goal is to survive all 14 days by maintaining your barricades and making sure your shelter remains protected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4544030/extras/df9d163a80fc9a82766f5f07f433487a.avif?t=1784487242\" width=1560 height=975 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a left-click pickup mechanic and a right-click throw mechanic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4544030/extras/232e413ccc3e0159cbf0be634bbd73df.poster.avif?t=1784487242\" width=1170 height=730 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4544030/extras/232e413ccc3e0159cbf0be634bbd73df.webm?t=1784487242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4544030/extras/232e413ccc3e0159cbf0be634bbd73df.mp4?t=1784487242\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your barricade and place it on the windows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/45440